keywords:
  - crystal rendering
  - mineralogy
  - WebGL2
  - information experience design
  - cybernetics
abstract: >-
  UniAether renders mineral crystals live in the browser. Each crystal is a set of
  faces taken from mineralogy; every pixel follows light through it: refraction,
  absorption by thickness, colour zoning, pleochroism, dispersion, fluorescence,
  and the coloured projection it casts. It grew out of the Ore Projection aesthetic
  system for Fufu, ISARO and the Crystal Atlas.
